-- Pool
ok   application error does not recreate resource
ok   IO failure: resource replaced and old resource closed
ok   task acquired resource before kill
ok   kill inside with: resource replaced
ok   pool holder acquired resource
ok   empty pool -> PoolTimeout
ok   with returns block value
ok   discard failure preserves slot and original error
ok   factory is not called when pool is created
ok   resource is reused instead of recreated
ok   factory error during checkout restores capacity
ok   factory cannot return nil
ok   interrupt during validate closes checked-out resource and restores capacity
ok   interrupt during close keeps slot quarantined
ok   no new resource is created after interrupted close
ok   max_lifetime: expired resource is closed and replaced
ok   validate: rejected resource is replaced
-- Response
ok   204 sends no body or Content-Length
ok   304 sends no body
ok   205 sends zero length and no body
ok   informational status cannot be sent as final response
ok   response formatting does not modify input
ok   unsafe header is rejected on insertion
ok   Date header is recognized case-insensitively
ok   coop_budget rejects negative values
