ok   route blocks receive the router context
ok   context JSON helper delegates response status and content type
ok   context status and header helpers
ok   route registration requires a handler
ok   GET selects its route and parameters
ok   POST selects its route
ok   HEAD uses GET
ok   405 lists methods without duplicates
ok   unknown path returns 404
ok   root route is found through index
ok   dynamic first segment preserves order
ok   static route also preserves order
ok   dynamic route works with a new prefix
ok   plain byte path is normalized to UTF-8
ok   percent-encoded segment is decoded
ok   invalid percent escape is rejected
ok   router chains and module scopes compose
ok   nested scope prefixes routes
ok   configure mounts module routes
ok   resource controller procedure accepts context
