-- Context
ok   all: result order preserved; nil and false are valid
ok   all: sibling error propagates immediately, not at deadline
ok   first: false is a successful result
ok   first: all tasks failed -> task error
ok   first: empty list -> ArgumentError
ok   subtask inherits request id and deadline
ok   all does not start tasks after deadline
ok   ctx.sleep observes deadline without thread-local state
-- CpuPool
ok   CPU task inherits request id
ok   CPU worker started task
ok   CPU queue is full
ok   full CPU queue at deadline -> DeadlineExceeded
-- Supervisor
ok   service retries until startup succeeds
ok   stop does not raise
-- Log
ok   newline cannot forge a log entry
ok   no log entries were dropped
-- Spinel guards
ok   AccessLog: logging failure does not erase completed response
ok   Rescue: error -> 500 without re-raise; outer ensure ran
ok   Pool#with: block error reaches caller and resource returns to pool
ok   Kiln.pause returns without recursing into Kernel.sleep
